    behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Saturn establishes structure, the other person's Pluto is already transforming what that foundation makes obsolete. When one person's Pluto demands death-and-rebirth, the other person's Saturn builds the new foundation. The conjunction means consolidation and transformation aren't separate—they're operating as a unified function between you. Use this for shared commitments that require both discipline and total transformation, foundations that can only be built through destruction of what came before.`,
